# Everything this repository must never publish lives in one directory.
#
# config.ini holds credentials; the corpus, expectations, digests, events and
# logs are all derived from real Social Schools posts, which name children,
# teachers and classes. One ignored root means one rule to get right instead of
# a dozen, and nothing personal ever sits beside a file you might casually add.
var/

# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.so
*.egg-info/
build/
dist/

# Tooling caches
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.coverage
htmlcov/

# Virtualenvs
.venv/
venv/
env/
.env

# Editors / OS
.DS_Store
.idea/
*.swp
